  "definition": "Emission Standards Applicable to Cyclone-Firing, Wet-Bottom Boilers",
  "effectiveDate": "2021-08-25",
  "historyNote": "#9846, eff 1-8-11; ss by #12766, eff 5-1-19; ss by #13254, eff 8-25-21",
